From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 21:44:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove auto_update + auto_update_ui +
 auto_update_helper crates

- Delete crates/auto_update, auto_update_ui, auto_update_helper.
- activity_indicator: define DismissMessage action locally.
- remote_connection: stub remote-server auto-download to return an error
  directing users to install the remote server manually.
- title_bar: drop update_version submodule and all auto_update UI surface
  (UpgradeRequired connection status, user-menu update indicator,
  SimulateUpdateAvailable debug action).
- zed: remove init calls and Check / ViewReleaseNotesLocally menu items;
  remove auto_update from action-namespaces test.
- settings_ui: remove auto_update settings page section.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
